            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi atemba eibanga ly'emizeituni amaguru gali bushai, ayebunzire omutwe nalira. Abo yabaire ainabo bona bayebunda emitwe batemba eibanga nibalira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamugambira bati, “Ahitofeli nawe ashengire na Abusalomu.” Daudi agamba ati, “Waitu Mukama, ninkushaba ebyo Ahitofeli arahanuura bitagasha kantu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Daudi yagobire aha ibanga eiguru mbali bafukamira Ruhanga, Hushai Omwariki aija kumutanganwa, ekijwarokye kitemwirwe n'eitaka limuli omu mutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi amugambira ati, “Katuragenda hamoi noija kundema iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi k'oragaruka omu kigo okagambira Abusalomu oti, ‘Waitu Mukama, ndaba mwiru wawe nk'okwo mbaire ndi mwiru wa sho kwema karai,’ aho oranyitira enama za Ahitofeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba oinayo Zadoki na Abiatari abakuhani. Aho kyona kyona eky'orahulira omu kikaare ky'Omukama, okigambire bonene abakuhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baina batabani babo bombili: Ahimaazi eya Zadoki na Yonatani eya Abiatari; abo nibo murantumaho kungambira ebyo muraba muhuliire byona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushai munywanyi wa Daudi agya atyo omu kigo, ashanga Abusalomu nataha Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
